  "text": "The worst anxiety I ever had,heart palpulatations.tingling in fingers Did lower bp.but at what cost when you do not hardly want to leave your home.\nSo stressed out over this!\nTook Diovan 80mg for about 7 years then went to 160 mg .That was not so bad.\nWas switched to Valstaran and now I am really getting anxiety, irregular heart beats and wound up in the er last week.\nThank goodness  blood work and ekg did check out ok.\nI could cry and I have to have my doctor get me off this!!!.\nThe last prescription was the worst.\nDifferent manufacture, may have different inactive ingredients in.\nI just want to be normal again.\n",
